<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113413" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρῐτ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>show grace to</i> any one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς χάριτος ἧς ἐχαρίτωσεν ἡμᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
					1.6
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαριτώσομαι</span> I <i>will bestow
				favour</i> upon thee, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1026 xxiii 24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to have grace shown one, to be highly favoured,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				18.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς πάντας ἀνθρώπους</span>
			Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				225
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Heph.Astr.
				1.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμμα στροφαῖς -ούμενον</span>
			prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Descr.</u>
				30.12
			</span></i>.</div>
